      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIDNIGHT STAR (1) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split and ran away with a 1.5 lengths win at Bulli over 340m in 19.21. Will go close again if runs up to latest. VINTAGE MEL (2) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten 2 lengths, (23.45) at this track. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Expecting another good run. APPIN WAY (8) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (23.68) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. FLYING FOR AARON (5) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
